This copy has been changed by the Advanced Rocketry project. Per section 4(b)
of the Apache License, Version 2.0, this notice states that the files in this
directory have been changed. The modifications include (non-exhaustive):

  - All Java sources delombok'd (Project Lombok removed); the @NonNull and
    @SneakyThrows residue that delombok leaves was rewritten by hand.
  - Remapped from MCP stable_39 to MCP snapshot_20171003 (Advanced Rocketry's
    mappings): member renames and access-transformer widenings.
  - Bundled (shaded) dependencies de-shaded to ordinary build dependencies.
  - Folded into Advanced Rocketry's single Forge mod container: the Valkyrien
    Skies @Mod / @Instance / @SidedProxy annotations were removed and its
    lifecycle is now driven by Advanced Rocketry; its @EventBusSubscriber
    handlers were re-owned by Advanced Rocketry's mod id.
  - The sponge_compatibility mixins and the JAR-signature (fingerprint) handler
    were removed; the bundled mcmod.info was removed (Valkyrien Skies is not a
    separate mod in this distribution).
  - Assorted mapping and mixin fixes required by the changes above.

